{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西貢沙角尾村發生停電事故。立法會議員方國珊今日（22日）晚上9時許在Facebook表示，西貢沙角尾村多間村屋停電，多戶居民大受影響，中電接報後到場搶修，正安排臨時供電。</p><p>圖中可見，工程人員正拖線提供臨時供電，居民在場視察。《香港01》正前往現場了解。</p><figure><img alt=\"工程人員正拖線提供臨時供電，居民在場視察。（方國珊Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190080921601052672306728.jpeg/531WsmoWs8qWgQC-IImQAPN7g7nxian9ItyhFSLcoRU\"/><figcaption>工程人員正拖線提供臨時供電，居民在場視察。（方國珊Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工程人員正拖線提供臨時供電。（方國珊Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190080924298121216734862.jpeg/9JVpXqvh7soGKPOWqZjx4NP3HIfSRVUGmR-orZkfqK0\"/><figcaption>工程人員正拖線提供臨時供電。（方國珊Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.109550+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:25:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:14.638461+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:14.638461+00:00","content_hash":"7fc30474171e1f5e29bdca18329ef0a503b4ed6e2b067e19641551e8daccc33e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}